{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52942","headline":"湘夫人祠 · 太易","name":"湘夫人祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵祠古木合，波扬大江濆。\n未作湘南雨，知爲何处云。\n苔痕涩珠履，草色妬罗裙。\n妙鼓彤云瑟，羁臣不可闻。\n（见明刻本《唐僧弘秀集》卷八、《古今禅藻集》卷四）（按：《全唐诗》卷八一○收此诗，有阙文，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52942.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52942","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}